   "parameters": {
    "content": "## 🧪 Asas 5 — Webhook (Mini API)\n\n### 🎯 Tujuan\nMencetuskan workflow daripada permintaan HTTP menggunakan node **Webhook**.\n\n### 🔨 Bina\n1. **+** → **Webhook** → Method `GET`, Path `jpj-echo`, Respond = **Using 'Respond to Webhook' Node**.\n2. **+** → **Edit Fields** → `status` = `diterima`, `data_anda` = `{{ $json.query }}`.\n3. **+** → **Respond to Webhook**.\n\n### 🧪 Uji\nWebhook node → **Listen for Test Event** → buka `localhost:5678/webhook-test/jpj-echo?nama=Ahmad`.\n\n### ✅ Semakan\nPelayar memaparkan JSON balasan daripada workflow.",
